MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1101863499}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6bfcc298534a8ca49a8ff8176d396a92, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  targetSceneName: Stage00
  rootPanel: {fileID: 238888506}
  backgroundImageRect: {fileID: 262358801}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 262358802}
  briefingText: {fileID: 645230297}
  fadeCanvasGroup: {fileID: 569050090}
  fadeImage: {fileID: 569050088}
  playOnStart: 1
  useUnscaledTime: 1
  minDisplaySeconds: 4
  typewriterCharsPerSecond: 15
  cuts:
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ff159d739e0e72e4385e195dbf445edd, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.5
    driftSpeed: 20
    driftScaleSpeed: 0
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 0.3
    fadeColor: 1
    line:
      korean: "\uBBF8\uAD6D\uC740 \uC9C0\uAE08 \uBD84\uC5F4\uB418\uACE0 \uC788\uB2E4."
      english: America is divided right now.
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00d762ec732d3944f87e8fcc6da69954, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.7
    driftSpeed: 20
    driftScaleSpeed: 0
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 0.3
    fadeColor: 1
    line:
      korean: "\uC880\uBE44\uB4E4\uC740 \uC815\uBD80\uC758 \uC815\uCC45\uC5D0 \uBC18\uB300\uD558\uBA70
        \uC0AC\uD68C \uD63C\uB780\uC744 \uC57C\uAE30\uD588\uB2E4."
      english: The zombies opposed the government's policies and caused social unrest.
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3c441d87d2898db4699c5e8ae5b6ccfa, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.7
    driftSpeed: 20
    driftScaleSpeed: -0.2
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 0.3
    fadeColor: 1
    line:
      korean: "\uC880\uBE44\uB85C \uC778\uD55C \uB0B4\uBD80 \uBD84\uC5F4\uC774 \uC2EC\uAC01\uD574\uC9C0\uC790
        \uC774\uC5D0 \uB9DE\uC11C \uC2E0\uC758 \uB9D0\uC500\uC744 \uB530\uB974\uB294
        \uAD70\uB300 ICE \uAC00 \uCC3D\uC124\uB41C\uB2E4."
      english: 'As internal divisions caused by the zombies grew increasingly severe,
        a new force was formed to fight back in accordance with the Word of God:
        I.C.E.'
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 45933e761b086b145830223acf7e782c, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.5
    driftSpeed: 0
    driftScaleSpeed: -0.5
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 1
    fadeColor: 0
    line:
      korean: "I.C.E. \u2014 International Christian Enforcement."
      english: "I.C.E. \u2014 International Christian Enforcement."
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70498c09b8912dc43b0d58ae9db52bf8, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.58
    driftSpeed: 0
    driftScaleSpeed: -0.5
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 1
    fadeColor: 0
    line:
      korean: "\uC560\uAD6D\uC2DC\uBBFC\uC774\uB77C\uBA74 \uB204\uAD6C\uB098 ICE\uAC00
        \uB420 \uC218 \uC788\uC73C\uBA70, \uD68C\uBE44\uB9CC \uB0A9\uBD80\uD558\uBA74
        \uC790\uACA9\uC774 \uC8FC\uC5B4\uC9C4\uB2E4."
      english: Any patriotic citizen can join I.C.E. Membership is granted simply
        by paying the required fee.
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5782766761edc5a46ace9c998cdcb7b6, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.58
    driftSpeed: 0
    driftScaleSpeed: -0.5
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 1
    fadeColor: 0
    line:
      korean: "ICE\uB294 \uC880\uBE44\uB4E4\uC744 \uC81C\uC555, \uAC10\uAE08, \uCD94\uBC29\uD560
        \uC218 \uC788\uB294 \uAD8C\uB9AC\uB97C \uAC00\uC9C4\uB2E4."
      english: I.C.E. has the authority to subdue, detain, and deport zombies.
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48f633dc7d7b33c47b846b5d9a326c5a, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.58
    driftSpeed: 0
    driftScaleSpeed: -0.5
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 1
    fadeColor: 0
    line:
      korean: "\uC774\uC81C \uBCF4\uAE30 \uC2EB\uC740 \uC880\uBE44\uB4E4\uC744 \uBBF8\uAD6D\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uCE58\uC6B0\uACE0"
      english: Clear America of the zombies you don't want to see.
  - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7b2769c28849ac54fa0c3b73acb87251, type: 3}
    targetAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    targetScale: 0.58
    driftSpeed: 0
    driftScaleSpeed: -0.5
    postTextHoldSeconds: 3
    fadeInDuration: 0.3
    fadeOutDuration: 1
    fadeColor: 0
    line:
      korean: "\uD558\uB098\uC758 \uBBF8\uAD6D\uC73C\uB85C \uB2E4\uC2DC \uD0DC\uC5B4\uB0A0
        \uC2DC\uAC04\uC774\uB2E4."
      english: It is time to make America one again.
